{"title":"2023 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/7/cb73c475844711741a44a4d1d4cd8e08a2ed382b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/4/844b44c84f163a0ad490ff30cf14d591043617f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3 + y = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a859acebdd07c34704648be45c0daf108e2a29d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/f/35fb1521c9ac88735f893d7b16fc21dc91614abf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 4 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 16 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 6 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 12 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"415\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can solve the first equation for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, solve the second equation for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and then add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> together.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/7/cb73c475844711741a44a4d1d4cd8e08a2ed382b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/f/def0cf0f13613c1ce9d085a7bfed8923174e0a32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5 - 3 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"110\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/4/844b44c84f163a0ad490ff30cf14d591043617f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3 + y = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/f/61f953081e4fa6ffa4505ae0b423f5f0258a8df4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 5 + 3 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/4/cc4acb281101513502e12ab905b110daf7d950ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = 2 + 8 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"196\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Both equations have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> with a coefficient of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so we can just add them together:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/f/15faf616f6d447a43a597669ffdeab2e443fb4c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + x - 3 + y = 5 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"171\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Simplifying both sides, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/d/9ed2996918241a86c62e857b4065cac761c50ad4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"131\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018023444\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 88/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3347/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:33898:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018023444 and revision id 260368. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}